#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3010
msgid "Text File Formats"
msgstr "Textfilformat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3012
msgid ""
"Files in the text file format are files in which the bytes represent the "
"text characters of a particular character set using a specific system to "
"relate the binary numbers in the file to the text characters of the set. "
"Such systems are called 'encodings' and become an issue when the file "
"includes characters that are not in the standard ASCII set, such as "
"characters in languages other than English. Character encodings are "
"explained in greater detail in <xref linkend=\"sect-file-textImport-complex-"
"encoding\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Textfiler består av byte som representerar texttecken i en viss "
"teckenuppsättning och använder en teckenkodning för att koppla filens binära"
" tal till tecknen. Teckenkodningar blir viktiga när filen innehåller tecken "
"som inte ingår i ASCII, till exempel tecken från andra språk än engelska. "
"Mer information finns i <xref linkend=\"sect-file-textImport-complex-"
"encoding\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3024
msgid ""
"Choosing <guimenuitem>Import Text File...</guimenuitem> menu item in the "
"<guimenuitem>Import Data</guimenuitem> submenu of the "
"<guimenuitem>Data</guimenuitem> menu or the <guimenuitem>Import Other "
"File...</guimenuitem> menu item in the <guimenuitem>Import "
"Data</guimenuitem> submenu of the <guimenuitem>Data</guimenuitem> menu and "
"specifying the \"Text import (configurable)\" or \"Text export "
"(configurable)\" file formats to open or save files will cause "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> to start the <interface>Text "
"Import</interface> or <interface>Text Export</interface> druids. These allow"
" the users to configure in detail the parameters with which existing files "
"will be read into a workbook or existing workbooks will be output to a file."
msgstr ""
"Om du väljer menyalternativet <guimenuitem>Importera "
"textfil...</guimenuitem> i undermenyn <guimenuitem>Importera "
"data</guimenuitem> i menyn <guimenuitem>Data</guimenuitem>, eller "
"alternativet <guimenuitem>Importera annan fil...</guimenuitem> i undermenyn "
"<guimenuitem>Importera data</guimenuitem> i menyn "
"<guimenuitem>Data</guimenuitem>, och väljer filformatet ”Textimport "
"(konfigurerbar)” eller ”Textexport (konfigurerbar)” startar "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> guiden <interface>Textimport</interface>"
" eller <interface>Textexport</interface>. Där kan du i detalj ange hur "
"befintliga filer ska läsas in i en arbetsbok eller hur arbetsböcker ska "
"skrivas till en fil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3041
msgid ""
"The Text file format includes a number of different formatting strategies "
"for text files in which data fields are structured in a regular pattern. "
"Most of these formats represent rows of data on different lines of the file "
"using different strategies to separated data values within each row. 'Fixed-"
"width' formats place each data entry in a separate column and therefore "
"limit the size of the data entries. 'Separated' formats use a special "
"character or character sequence to separate entries. For instance, the comma"
" separated value, the tab separated value formats and the space separated "
"value formats use commas, tabs, and spaces respectively to separate the data"
" fields."
msgstr ""
"Textfilformatet omfattar flera sätt att strukturera datafält i ett "
"regelbundet mönster. Raderna i filen innehåller vanligtvis datarader och "
"varje värde avgränsas på olika sätt. Format med fast bredd placerar varje "
"värde i en egen kolumn och begränsar därmed värdenas storlek. I avgränsade "
"format skiljs värden åt med ett särskilt tecken eller en teckensekvens. "
"Kommaseparerade, tabbseparerade och blankstegsseparerade format använder "
"till exempel kommatecken, tabbar respektive blanksteg som avgränsare."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3055
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can import and export files from and to "
"a wide variety of text file formats when the text importer or the text "
"exporter is configured appropriately. File can be generated with many "
"different encodings. See the section on <link linkend=\"sect-file-"
"textImport\">importing text files</link> or the section on <link "
"linkend=\"sect-file-textExport\">exporting text files</link> for an "
"explanation of how to import or export these formatted text files."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan importera och exportera många olika "
"textfilformat när textimportören eller textexportören är rätt inställd. "
"Filer kan skapas med många olika teckenkodningar. I avsnitten om <link "
"linkend=\"sect-file-textImport\">import av textfiler</link> och <link "
"linkend=\"sect-file-textExport\">export av textfiler</link> förklaras hur du"
" importerar och exporterar dessa textformat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3074
msgid "Text File Format"
msgstr "Textfilformat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3080
msgid "<literal>.text</literal> / <literal>.txt</literal> / none"
msgstr "<literal>.text</literal> / <literal>.txt</literal> / none"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3087
msgid "Many programs can read and create formatted text files"
msgstr "Många program kan läsa och skapa formaterade textfiler"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3106
msgid ""
"The exporter can only create text files using a separator character and "
"cannot create fixed-width structured files."
msgstr ""
"Textexportören kan endast skapa textfiler med avgränsningstecken. Den kan "
"inte skapa strukturerade filer med fast bredd."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3129
msgid ""
"Text file format files are simple text files containing the data for each "
"cell of the worksheet organized in a systematic fashion."
msgstr ""
"Textfilerna innehåller kalkylbladets cellvärden i en enkel textstruktur."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3142
msgid ""
"Text format files can be processed using any tool which operates on text "
"files, and many other applications can read or generate one or more of these"
" formats."
msgstr ""
"Du kan bearbeta textfiler med alla verktyg som hanterar text. Många andra "
"program kan också läsa och skapa ett eller flera av dessa format."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3165
msgid "<command>TROFF</command> File Format"
msgstr "Filformatet <command>TROFF</command>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3167
msgid ""
"The <command>TROFF</command> file format is a text file format with markup "
"in <literal>TROFF</literal>."
msgstr ""
"<command>TROFF</command> är ett textbaserat filformat med märkning i "
"<literal>TROFF</literal>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3172
msgid ""
"The <command>TROFF</command> system is a documentation preparation system "
"that can generate many different output files from an input file with "
"standard markup. <application>Gnumeric</application> produces a file that "
"can be used as input to the <command>TROFF</command> system or its GNU "
"project replacement, <command>GROFF</command>."
msgstr ""
"<command>TROFF</command> är ett system för dokumentframställning som kan "
"skapa olika utdatafiler från en källfil med standardiserad märkning. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> skapar en fil som kan användas som "
"indata till <command>TROFF</command> eller dess ersättare från GNU-"
"projektet, <command>GROFF</command>."
